  "limitations": [
    "Only Linux arm64 in the required image was validated; no macOS, Windows or other RID support is established. Packaging/relocation and live browser parity remain out of scope.",
    "The unchanged shared runtime has SHA256 3d347492e519a522947a3d56ed3ea8fe4e1eed3d9e0f916349d564176e2e53d0. Broad native regression still fails at the known held-layer-page SIGSEGV: https://github.com/roanutil/embed-pdf-viewer/issues/16. No runtime substitution or test skip was used.",
    "Facade default annotation/widget rendering passes independently; that test does not recreate the held-layer-page regression.",
    "Managed slot/byte counters return to zero. The frozen C ABI exposes no public registry counters; repeated operations under small native job/result/input limits verify native capacity reuse without claiming direct counter inspection.",
    "Logs trim trailing blank lines and replace container worktree/target prefixes with <worktree>/<cargo-target>; hashes describe these checked-in normalized logs. Native binaries and generated managed binaries remain local, referenced by relative artifact paths and SHA256 only.",
